只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Keyboard-first command palette for DeepSeek Harness Web","id":"gh:1333136466","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-spotlight","slug":"0xsline/dsh-spotlight","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Keyboard-first command palette for DeepSeek Harness Web"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Spotlight"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A keyboard-first command palette for DeepSeek Harness Web. Open one palette to\nfind native slash com"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"mands, recent sessions, visible UI actions, and installed\nplugin settings—without leaving the keyboa"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ds, recent sessions, visible UI actions, and installed\nplugin settings—without leaving the keyboard."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **One shortcut:** `⌘K` on macOS, `Ctrl+K` on other platforms.\n- **Customizable:** click the shortc"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ut control in the footer, then press a new\nkey combination. The setting is stored in the current bro"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"wser.\n- **Native actions:** discovers and triggers the actions already provided by\nDSH Web, and cont"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ributes one `/spotlight` command to the native slash menu\ninstead of maintaining a second command re"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"gistry.\n- **Fast search:** deterministic fuzzy matching across slash commands, recent\nsessions, UI a"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"ctions, and plugin settings.\n- **Keyboard navigation:** Arrow Up/Down to select, Enter to run, Escap"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"e to\nclose.\n- **Clean lifecycle:** removes its event listeners, styles, and DOM nodes when\nunloaded."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Install the bundle into your DSH Web profile. From npm:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Or from the Git source:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The Git install runs the package's `prepare` lifecycle because generated\n`lib/` files are not commit"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ted. It deletes and recreates only this package's\n`lib/` directory with the repository-local TypeScr"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ipt and tsdown executables;\nit does not access the network or write outside the checkout. If lifecyc"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"le\nscripts are disabled, install the npm release instead: it already contains the\nbuilt `lib/` files"},{"id":"p12s5","text":" and does not run `prepare` during installation."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then start DSH Web and press `⌘K` or `Ctrl+K`:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"1. Open Spotlight with the global shortcut, or type `/spotlight` in the DSH\nWeb composer and pick th"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"e entry from the slash menu.\n2. Type to filter commands and actions.\n3. Use Arrow Up/Down and Enter,"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" or click a result.\n4. Click **Shortcut** in the footer to record a different key combination.\n5. Cl"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ick **Reset** to restore the platform default."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Shortcut preferences are local to the current browser origin and profile."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"DSH Spotlight is a standalone Cordis bundle with a small Web client. The\nclient mounts once the host"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"'s sessions, command-plane, plugin-inventory, and\ncommand-UI services exist — all standard in every "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"stock DSH Web deployment —\nthen reads recent sessions, slash commands, and the plugin inventory dire"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ctly\nfrom those services. It also discovers actionable elements in the current page\nand delegates ex"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"ecution back to those native elements. A catalog RPC failure\ndegrades only its own category. The plu"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"gin adds no server data channel and\nstores no durable server-side state."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Because part of the discovery follows the current DSH Web DOM, host UI\nchanges may require updating "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"the selectors in `src/spotlight/discovery.ts`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Requirements: Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0` and pnpm `11.7.0`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Test a local checkout in DSH Web:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Inspect the package contents before publishing:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
